show the shared services: state, addresses, definition and connection

Usage:
  treerig shared status [flags]

Flags:
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -h, --help            help for status
      --json            machine-readable output

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto or plain (one line per
                        change) (default "auto")
